{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "cjson",
  "version": "1.7.19",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://codeload.github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON/tar.gz/refs/tags/v1.7.19",
    "archive": "cJSON-1.7.19.tar.gz",
    "source_dir": "cjson-1.7.19",
    "sha256": "7fa616e3046edfa7a28a32d5f9eacfd23f92900fe1f8ccd988c1662f30454562"
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "build": {
    "system": "amalgamation",
    "sources": ["cJSON.c"],
    "archive": "libcjson.a",
    "shared": true,
    "install_headers": ["cJSON.h"],
    "cflags": ["-DCJSON_HIDE_SYMBOLS"]
  },
  "tests": [
    {"name": "roundtrip-static", "source": "porting/tests/cjson_roundtrip.c", "cflags": ["-I@PORT_PREFIX@/include", "-DCJSON_HIDE_SYMBOLS"], "link_args": ["@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libcjson.a"], "expect_stdout": "cjson_roundtrip: ok"},
    {"name": "roundtrip-shared", "source": "porting/tests/cjson_roundtrip.c", "cflags": ["-I@PORT_PREFIX@/include", "-DCJSON_HIDE_SYMBOLS"], "env": {"CRT_CXX_RUNTIME_LINKAGE": "shared"}, "target_overrides": {
      "linux": {"link_args": ["@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libcjson.so"]},
      "macos": {"link_args": ["@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libcjson.dylib"]},
      "windows": {"link_args": ["@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/cjson.dll"]}
    }, "expect_stdout": "cjson_roundtrip: ok"}
  ],
  "status": {"linux": "planned", "macos": "planned", "windows": "planned"},
  "notes": [
    "Embedded C JSON parser/encoder (MIT), selected for its small ANSI C implementation; no claim of measured market-share ranking. Unmodified upstream cJSON.c/cJSON.h are built against CRT.",
    "CJSON_HIDE_SYMBOLS disables upstream's Windows dllimport/dllexport annotations for the CRT GNU-like toolchain; its shared linker exports public definitions. This is a build configuration, not an upstream patch. Static and shared consumers use the same header configuration."
  ]
}
